WEBVTT

00:11:56.303 --> 00:12:00.073
To paraphrase Chavez, once
social change begins,

00:12:00.097 --> 00:12:02.165
it cannot be reversed.

00:12:02.189 --> 00:12:05.392
You cannot humiliate
the person who feels pride.

00:12:05.416 --> 00:12:07.183
You cannot oppress the people

00:12:07.207 --> 00:12:09.667
who are not afraid anymore.

00:12:09.691 --> 00:12:12.311
For me, the achievements
of the Hearing Voices Movement

00:12:12.335 --> 00:12:14.745
are a reminder that empathy, fellowship,

00:12:14.769 --> 00:12:17.489
justice and respect are more than words;

00:12:17.513 --> 00:12:20.100
they are convictions and beliefs,

00:12:20.124 --> 00:12:22.586
and that beliefs can change the world.

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.361
In the last 20 years,
the Hearing Voices Movement

00:12:25.385 --> 00:12:27.573
has established hearing voices networks

00:12:27.597 --> 00:12:30.564
in 26 countries across five continents,